Package: pgscorer
Title: Compute Polygenic Risk Scores from PGS Catalog Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("John", "Morrison", email = "jmorr@usc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes polygenic risk scores (PRS) from PGS Catalog scoring
    files against a BGZF-compressed VCF file. Unions positions across all
    models, queries the VCF once per position in batches, then scores each
    model from the shared dosage table. On Windows batches run in-process;
    on other platforms each batch runs in an isolated Rscript subprocess to
    bound peak memory usage.
